        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaasuri bagotianera Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 18:13-27; 2 Amg 32:1-19)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o ikomi na kane bw’okogaamba kw’omorwoti Hezekia, Senakeribu, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, akagenda, akarwania emechie yonsi y’Abayuda yagiteire chindwaki, akayebua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti oyio bw’Abaasuri agatoma Rabi‐Sake korwa Lakisi amo nabasikari abange agende ase Hezekia agwo Yerusalemu. Rabi‐Sake agatenena ase omotaro bwe ritibo ria rogoro ase enchera ekogenda ase egetii ki’omosibia bw’ebitambaa bikoroisigwa chianga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Eliakimu, mosinto o Hilikia, omoteneneri bw’enyomba y’omorwoti, na Sebuna omoriki, na Yoa mosinto bw’Asafu, oyorenge omoriki bw’amang’ana are gokoreka, bagacha aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabi‐Sake akabateebia ng’a bateebie Hezekia iga: “Aya naro omorwoti omonene, oria bw’Abaasuri, agokwana: Niigoro yang’o obegete ogosemeria kwao?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo okorengereria ng’a ogokwana kw’amang’ana gwoka nakwo koganeirie ase okomanya korwana esegi na koyebua? Ning’o osemeretie oraoboseemia goika kwangire konyingwera inche?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora bono, aye nigo osemeretie ense y’Abamisiri, eyio enga buna egetonto kebunegete. Omonto onde bwensi okogiesiirera, ekio nigo keramokebe okoboko. Naboigo Farao omorwoti o Misiri are ase abanto bonsi abwo bamosemeretie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inee! Inwe nigo mogonteebia ng’a nigo mosemeretie Omonene, Nyasae oino? Tari ere oria aase aye aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa amo nebisasimero biaye Hezekia atagoire, agateebia Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu: Mobe mogosasiima bosio bw’egesasiimero eke!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inchuo moigwane mobeke rigori n’Omonene one, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri. Nimbae chibarasi chilifu ibere komoranyare konyora abariini be chibarasi echio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki moranyare kobua omoteneneri oyomo ore omoke ase egati y’abasomba b’omonene one, ekero mosemeretie ense ya Misiri ase okonyora chigari na abariini chibarasi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Nigo mokagete ng’a inche nigo nachire korwania ense eye na koyesari’Omonene atancheti? Taibo; Omonene nere onteebia: Genda orwanie ense eria oyesarie!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Eliakimu, na Sebuna, na Yoa, bagateebia Rabi‐Sake: “Koranche okwane naintwe, abasomba bao, ase omonwa bw’Ekearamaiki, ekiagera ntoyomanyete; tobaisa gokwana naintwe ase omonwa bw’Ekeyuda ekero abanto bare ase orwaki igoro bategererete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabi‐Sake agateeba, “Inee! Omonene one nigo antoma nkwane amang’ana aya ase Omonene oino na ase more mweka? Yaya, tantomete ase inwe mweka, korende nase abanto baikaransete ase orwaki igoro, abwo banacheirwe ekiina amo nainwe bagochia koria obonyira bwabo na konywa amasinyoro abo bagoitera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Rabi‐Sake agatenena, agaaka eriogi rinene ase omonwa bw’Ekeyuda, agateeba: “Igwa ring’ana ri’omorwoti omonene, ore omorwoti bw’Abaasuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro omorwoti agokwana: Timobaisa gwancha Hezekia abang’aine, ekiagera ere takonyara kobatooria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa gwancha Hezekia abasirie ng’a mosemerie Omonene ekero agoteeba: Ekeene, Omonene natotoorie, na omochie oyo tokobekwa ase okoboko kw’omorwoti bw’Abaasuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa gotegerera amang’ana a Hezekia. Aya naro omorwoti bw’Abaasuri agoteeba: Kora omorembe nainche, moche ase ’nde. Erio kera omonto ase more narie okwama kw’emesabibu na okw’emeko yaye omonyene, na kera oyomo oino nanywe amaache ’ensoko yaye omonyene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goika inchiche imbarusie agwo mbaire ase ense egwekaine buna ense eyio yaino, ense ere ne chindagera, na edivai, ense ere nemegati na emegondo y’emesabibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morende mono, ekero Hezekia akobang’aina, ogoteeba: Omonene natotoorie. Inee! Enyasae ende yonsi y’ebisaku yatooririe ense yaye korwa ase okoboko kwane inche omorwoti bw’Abaasuri?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’ai chinyasae chia Hamati na Aripadi chire? Inee! Chinyasae chia Sefariwaimu, ng’ai chire? Chiatooririe ense ya Samaria korwa ase okoboko kwane?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nereri ase egati ye chinyasae chionsi chie chinse echio yatooririe ense yaye korwa ase okoboko kwane? Nainwe nigo mokorengereria ng’a Omonene natoorie Yerusalemu korwa ase okoboko kwane?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abanto bagakira‐kiri, tibamoiraneria nonya ne ring’ana erimo, ekiagera omorwoti konya ochikiire iga: “Timobaisa komoiraneria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Eliakimu, mosinto o Hilikia, oria orenge omoteneneri bw’enyomba y’omorwoti, na Sebuna omoriki, na Yoa mosinto bw’Asafu, omoriki bw’amang’ana are gokoreka, bagacha ase Hezekia bare ne chianga chitandogete, bakamoteebia amang’ana ayio Rabi‐Sake akwanete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
